{
"d31e4280795cc44c":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_Welcome",
"zh":[
"你好！让你久等了！",
"欢迎来到宝可梦的世界！",
"我叫小田卷。",
"不过大家都叫我宝可梦博士。"
]
},
"b950738ab9547799":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_MainSpeech",
"zh":[
"这个世界上到处都生活着叫做宝可梦的生物。",
"我们人类和宝可梦一起生活，有时是友好的玩伴，有时是互相合作的伙伴。",
"有时候，我们也会联手和别人对战。",
"不过，虽然我们这么亲近，我们对宝可梦还是不够了解。",
"其实，宝可梦身上还有很多很多秘密。",
"为了解开宝可梦的谜团，我一直在做研究。这就是我的工作。"
]
},
"d09cb5c51ff9ba60":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_AndYouAre",
"zh":[
"那么，你是？"
]
},
"65a71b4d52726c59":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl",
"zh":[
"你是男孩？还是女孩？"
]
},
"6552021895b35885":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_WhatsYourName",
"zh":[
"好的。你叫什么名字？"
]
},
"961dcec16373f778":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer",
"zh":[
"你是{PLAYER}{KUN}吗？"
]
},
"7ad440d62bd1d288":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_YourePlayer",
"zh":[
"啊，原来如此！",
"你就是要搬到我的家乡未白镇来的{PLAYER}{KUN}啊。我明白了！"
]
},
"62b369d456381884":{
"id":"data/text/birch_speech.inc:gText_Birch_AreYouReady",
"zh":[
"好了，准备好了吗？",
"属于你自己的冒险就要开始了。",
"鼓起勇气，跳进充满梦想、冒险和友谊的宝可梦世界吧！",
"那么，我等你过来。到我的宝可梦研究所来找我吧。"
]
},
"66296aa62e4020e6":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_OurNewHomeLetsGoInside",
"zh":[
"妈妈：{PLAYER}，亲爱的，我们到了！",
"跟着行李坐搬家卡车，一定很累吧。",
"这里就是未白镇。",
"你觉得怎么样？这是我们的新家！",
"虽然有点古朴，但看起来是个住着很舒服的地方，你说呢？",
"还有，{PLAYER}，你会有自己的房间哦！我们进去吧。"
]
},
"e37da507dc0870ad":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_WaitPlayer",
"zh":[
"妈妈：等一下，{PLAYER}！"
]
},
"b1dc1a567a3eb014":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_WearTheseRunningShoes",
"zh":[
"妈妈：{PLAYER}！{PLAYER}！你跟小田卷博士打过招呼了吗？",
"哎呀！好可爱的宝可梦！是小田卷博士给你的吧。真好！",
"你果然是你爸爸的孩子。你和宝可梦在一起真合适！",
"来，亲爱的！如果你要出去冒险，就穿上这双跑步鞋吧。",
"穿上它，你的脚步会变得很轻快！"
]
},
"5894ae909fc49936":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_SwitchShoesWithRunningShoes",
"zh":[
"{PLAYER}换上了跑步鞋。"
]
},
"4efab51d54855ad4":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_CanUsePCToStoreItems",
"zh":[
"用电脑的话，可以存放道具和宝可梦。",
"科学的力量真是太厉害了！"
]
},
"a1fdb18a7e9e17bc":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_IfYouGoInGrassPokemonWillJumpOut",
"zh":[
"嗯，嗯，嗯！",
"如果走到外面的草丛里，野生的宝可梦就会跳出来！"
]
},
"e920f2b8fb469690":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_DangerousIfYouDontHavePokemon",
"zh":[
"如果你没有自己的宝可梦，那是很危险的。"
]
},
"99298b1ebf2e3d9e":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_YouSavedBirch",
"zh":[
"你救了小田卷博士！我太高兴了！"
]
},
"44f15c7c559431c9":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_GoodLuckCatchingPokemon",
"zh":[
"你要去抓宝可梦吗？加油！"
]
},
"e2f7106a6cde6ff1":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_ProfBirchsLab",
"zh":[
"小田卷博士的宝可梦研究所"
]
},
"599ce2ed7863b269":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_PlayersHouse",
"zh":[
"{PLAYER}的家"
]
},
"4c82d85299eec749":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_ProfBirchsHouse",
"zh":[
"小田卷博士的家"
]
},
"08da08b4fa7c78ae":{
"id":"data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:LittlerootTown_Text_BirchSomethingToShowYouAtLab",
"zh":[
"小田卷博士：哎呀哎呀，{PLAYER}{KUN}！你在外面干得很好！",
"我第一次见到你的时候，就觉得你有点特别，不过真没想到会这样。",
"对了，我给你的宝可梦图鉴还在吗？",
"我有东西要给你看。我们去我的研究所吧。"
]
},
"14928ad6d264aa98":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_SavingMyProgress",
"zh":[
"我想休息一下，所以先保存进度。"
]
},
"656e418237deaf72":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_IWorkAtPokemonMart",
"zh":[
"你好！我在宝可梦商店工作。",
"能请你跟我来一下吗？"
]
},
"36405ed6e9c64e0d":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_ThisIsAPokemonMart",
"zh":[
"这里是宝可梦商店。认准我们的蓝色屋顶就行。",
"我们出售各种商品，包括用来捕捉宝可梦的精灵球。",
"来，这个送给你，算是促销赠品。"
]
},
"7eab686664bd9c3f":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_PotionExplanation",
"zh":[
"伤药随时都能用，所以在某些情况下，它比宝可梦中心还方便呢。"
]
},
"53e3299c3d502044":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_WaitDontComeInHere",
"zh":[
"啊啊啊！等等！请不要进来。",
"我刚刚发现了稀有宝可梦的脚印！",
"等我写完生再进来，好吗？"
]
},
"a16a6680b507a004":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_DiscoveredFootprints",
"zh":[
"我刚刚发现了稀有宝可梦的脚印！",
"等我写完生再进来，好吗？"
]
},
"ff9ea4ef858485bd":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_MayLetsGoBack",
"zh":[
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}！这边！我们快回家吧！"
]
},
"f579a6d2aa9b97af":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Text_BrendanLetsGoBack",
"zh":[
"小悠：我现在要回爸爸的研究所了。{PLAYER}，你也快点回去吧。"
]
},
"0cbd7a23498af925":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_House1/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_House1_Text_LeftPokemonGoesOutFirst",
"zh":[
"宝可梦对战时，列表中靠左的那只会先出场。",
"所以，等你的队伍里宝可梦多了，试着调整一下它们的顺序吧。",
"说不定能给你带来优势。"
]
},
"6d2878cd8e0342ec":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_House2/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_House2_Text_PokemonLevelUp",
"zh":[
"宝可梦在对战中会逐渐升级，变得越来越强。"
]
},
"a347ddc365bf40af":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_House2/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_House2_Text_YoullGoFurtherWithStrongPokemon",
"zh":[
"如果身边的宝可梦变强了，你就能去离这里更远的地方了。"
]
},
"c0396b100b8eed4c":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_Mart/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Mart_Text_PokeBallsAreSoldOut",
"zh":[
"店员说全都卖光了。我买不到精灵球了。"
]
},
"8f7c5ae2161830ca":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_Mart/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Mart_Text_ImGoingToBuyPokeBalls",
"zh":[
"我要买一大堆精灵球，抓一大堆宝可梦！"
]
},
"efca080f754fbcff":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_Mart/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_Mart_Text_RestoreHPWithPotion",
"zh":[
"宝可梦受伤后HP减少，如果倒下了，就不能再战斗了。",
"为了防止宝可梦倒下，用伤药帮它回复HP吧。"
]
},
"8b562c601d791ab3":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrainersCanUsePC",
"zh":[
"角落里那台电脑，任何宝可梦训练家都可以使用。",
"当然，也就是说你也可以随便用。"
]
},
"0b7525bf7eccc60b":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokemonCentersAreGreat",
"zh":[
"宝可梦中心真棒！",
"这里的服务可以随便使用，而且全都免费。完全不用操心！"
]
},
"ed93507e2dfcfd84":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WirelessClubNotAvailable",
"zh":[
"二楼新开了宝可梦无线俱乐部。",
"不过听说他们还在做调整。"
]
},
"644653959759f1ec":{
"id":"data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradedInWirelessClub",
"zh":[
"二楼新开了宝可梦无线俱乐部。",
"我马上就交换了宝可梦。"
]
},
"cb3711b8fd27bb62":{
"id":"data/maps/Route101/scripts.inc:Route101_Text_HelpMe",
"zh":[
"救、救救我！"
]
},
"467609f199dbf41a":{
"id":"data/maps/Route101/scripts.inc:Route101_Text_PleaseHelp",
"zh":[
"喂！那边那位！拜托！帮帮我！",
"我的背包里！有精灵球！"
]
},
"331c3f023e8689f0":{
"id":"data/maps/Route101/scripts.inc:Route101_Text_DontLeaveMe",
"zh":[
"你、你要去哪儿？！别把我丢在这儿啊！"
]
},
"82ff7e4e9bd9ec05":{
"id":"data/maps/Route101/scripts.inc:Route101_Text_TakeTiredPokemonToPokeCenter",
"zh":[
"如果宝可梦累了，就带它们去宝可梦中心吧。",
"古辰镇就有一家宝可梦中心，离这儿很近。"
]
},
"ea49f5b12d55331e":{
"id":"data/maps/Route101/scripts.inc:Route101_Text_WildPokemonInTallGrass",
"zh":[
"野生的宝可梦会从高高的草丛里跳出来。",
"如果你想捕捉宝可梦，就得走进高高的草丛里找。"
]
},
"157dcdcf9a6ef4ba":{
"id":"data/maps/Route101/scripts.inc:Route101_Text_RouteSign",
"zh":[
"101号道路 {UP_ARROW} 古辰镇"
]
}
}